     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Dr. Yu,<div><br></div><div>  I am currently trying to load an ASTRAL tree into R, and I&#39;ve tried both read.tree and read.astral and I have the same error. Because <span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">ASTRAL cannot estimate terminal branch length, so some of the edge.length values will be NaN and the trees will be drawn as a cladogram with the following warning:</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Warning message:</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">In fortify.phylo(data, ...) : &#39;edge.length&#39; contains NA values...</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">## setting &#39;edge.length&#39; to NULL automatically when plotting the tree...</span></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Is there a way of getting around this issue?  It seems like you can add dummy values in ASTRAL but I am not sure how (</span><a href=\"https://github.com/smirarab/ASTRAL/issues/10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/smirarab/ASTRAL/issues/10&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482108545000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cgqT5wWRDEuOOokYyUxaD\">https://github.com/smirarab/ASTRAL/issues/10</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br>Thanks,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Miles</span></div></div>"
